{"id":86221,"slug":"v-sle-9-2014","title":"V čísle 9","title_en":"Inside No. 9","year":2014,"rating":83,"votes_count":551,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Komediálny seriál ponúka pohľad do šiestich veľmi rozličných domov s číslom 9, v ktorých sa obyčajné a každodenné životy preplietajú s neobyčajnými a nečakanými zážitkami. Vo veľkom vidieckom dome vedie hra na „sardinky\" k prekvapujúcim odhaleniam záhad ukrytých v skrini. Zo veľmi starého strašidelného domu sa presunieme do šatne nevraživého herca v londýnskom West End-e. Cestu zakončíme v byte zdanlivo spokojnej učiteľky základnej školy, ktorá sa stáva obeťou svojho dobrého skutku. Každé z obydlí ponúka nepredvídateľne vtipné momenty, ktoré sa razom môžu zmeniť na desivé a hrozivé.(Incantator)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/159/699/159699756_d5b498.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie"],"tags":["muž","žena","strach","černý humor","antologie"],"countries":["Velká Británie"],"directors":["David Kerr","Guillem Morales","Steve Pemberton","Graeme Harper","Dan Zeff","Reece Shearsmith","Jim O'Hanlon","Matt Lipsey","Louise Hooper","Al Campbell","Kieron J. Walsh","George Kane","Barbara Wiltshire"],"actors":["Steve Pemberton","Reece Shearsmith","Gemma Arterton","Anna Chancellor","Adam Deacon","Tamsin Greig","Conleth Hill","Katherine Parkinson","Anne Reid","Sophie Thompson","Marc Wootton","Julian Rhind-Tutt","Luca Pasqualino","Ophelia Lovibond","Timothy West","Ben Willbond","Tim Key","Oona Chaplin","Denis Lawson","Kayvan Novak","Joyce Veheary","Lucy Hutchinson","David Bedella","Rosie Cavaliero","Julia Davis","Lyndsey Marshal","Helen McCrory","Julie Hesmondhalgh","Jessica Ellerby","Sean Buckley","Di Botcher","Trevor Cooper","Vicky Hall","Lorraine Ashbourne","Jim Howick","Cariad Lloyd","Jessica Raine","Rula Lenska","Derek Jacobi","Dan Starkey","Aimee-Ffion Edwards","Tony Way","Alice Lowe","Naz Osmanoglu","Philip Glenister","Jason Watkins","Sarah Hadland","Tamzin Outhwaite","Javone Prince","Roger Sloman","Jessica Gunning","Jack Whitehall","Paul Copley","Tom Riley","Sheridan Smith","Paul Kaye","Sinead Matthews","Ruth Sheen","David Warner","Nikki Amuka-Bird","Jane Horrocks","Claire Skinner","Sophie McShera","Alison Steadman","Alexandra Roach","Richard Cordery","Michele Dotrice","Bruce Mackinnon","Mathew Baynton","Keeley Hawes","Cavan Clerkin","Chris Wilson","Kevin Eldon","Tanya Franks","Rory Kinnear","Hattie Morahan","Bill Paterson","Marcia Warren","Sian Gibson","Monica Dolan","Nick Moran","David Calder","Emilia Fox","Nicola Walker","Kenneth Cranham","Noel Clarke","Zoë Wanamaker","Fenella Woolgar","Phoebe Sparrow","Nigel Planer","Weruche Opia","Helen Monks","Mark Benton","Rufus Jones","Caden Ellis Wall","Stacy Liu","Eve Austin","Jenna Coleman","Kadiff Kirwan","Sarah Solemani","David Bamber","David Morrissey","Steve Speirs","Ralf Little","Bobby Schofield","Fionn Whitehead","Tom Goodman-Hill","Jill Halfpenny","Maxine Peake","Phil Davis","Sara Kestelman","Rebecca Callard","Dipo Ola","Sian Clifford","Lindsay Duncan","Nick Mohammed","Julian Glover","Sarah Parish","Aaron Neil","Adrian Dunbar","Bhavna Limbachia","Pauline McLynn","Kevin Bishop","Gemma Whelan","Paterson Joseph","Dino Kelly","Rosa Robson","Jack Wolfe","Ioanna Kimbook","Mark Gatiss","Diane Morgan","Annette Badland","Siobhan Redmond","Sophie Okonedo","Jason Isaacs","Daniel Mays","Daisy Haggard","Jessica Hynes","Simon Callow","Tom Mulheron","Siobhan Finneran","Mark Bonnar","Susan Wokoma","Joel Fry","Charlie Cooper","Katherine Kelly","Dorothy Atkinson","Adrian Scarborough","Vinette Robinson","Eddie Marsan","Natalie Dormer","Hayley Squires","Debbie Rush","Bamshad Abedi-Amin","Callum Coates","Rebekah Hinds","Stephanie Cole","Rich Keeble","Emma Stannard","James Tucker","Donna Preston","Isabelle Pratt"],"screenwriters":["Steve Pemberton","Reece Shearsmith"],"cinematographers":["Stephan Pehrsson","John Sorapure","Tony Coldwell","James Moss","Sean Van Hales"],"composers":["Christian Henson"],"reviews":[{"author":"kagemush","text":"Ano, některé díly jsou slabší (stejný model jako u ,Neuvěřitelných příběhů´-ingliš humor,každý díl o něčem jiném a velké rozdíly v kvalitě). Ale i ty nejslabší jsou vysoko nad průměrem. A s ohledem na to, že několik dílů mě rozsekalo (třeba pocta němým groteskám-dva lupiči, služka, starý pán a jeho diva -je třicet minut smíchu s pointou jak od Hitchcoka na tripu) to musí být za plný počet.(04.03.2020)","stars":5},{"author":"PanCitron","text":"To, co Pemberton se Shearsmithem dokáží vytvořit na poli jedné půlhodiny je občas neskutečné. Tolik nápadů, překvapivých zvratů a sympatických postav by mohl závidět kde jaký mnohem \"ambicióznější spektákl\". Pravda, ne vždy to vyjde úplně dokonale, ale i tak každý díl obsahuje nějaký ten moment, kvůli kterému stojí za to vidět.Oblíbené díly:1x03 - Tom & Gerri, 2x02 - The 12 Days of Christine, 3x01 - The Devil of Christmas, 3x05 - Diddle Diddle Dumpling, 4x01 - Zanzibar, 4x02 - Bernie Clifton's Dressing Room(09.02.2018)","stars":4},{"author":"misterz","text":"Pôsobivé, čo títo dvaja komici dokázali vytvoriť. Predovšetkým musím pochváliť hereckú stránku - sympatickí herci, výborné výkony, čistá britská angličtina, ktorá si pýta veľkú dávku trpezlivosti a zvyk. Nemám námietky ani k technickej stránke, pri ktorej vynikla najmä pekná kamera a šikovný strih. S obsahom to bolo trocha horšie. Sú tu napríklad geniálne epizódy, pri ktorých sa divák nielenže pučí od smiechu, ale ktoré dokážu prekvapiť aj svojou prepracovanou pointou, ale aj nezáživné a nudné diely (napr. prvé dva diely 4. série). To však pripisujem na vrub až príliš britskému humoru, ktorému našinec skrátka nemá šancu rozumieť. Preto si myslím, že britský divák si užije aj tie. Tých výborných dielov však bolo viac, takže na slabší nadpriemer to bohato stačí.70/100(15.03.2019)","stars":4}],"vods":[],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/343031-v-cisle-9/prehled/","root_id":343031,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":9,"episode_count":55,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2022-04-20","last_vod_date":"2024-06-12","episodes":[{"season_no":7,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2022-04-20","title":"Merrily, Merrily (S07E01)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":7,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2022-04-27","title":"Mr. King (S07E02)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":7,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2022-05-04","title":"Nine Lives Kat (S07E03)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":7,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2022-05-11","title":"Kid/Nap (S07E04)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":7,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2022-05-25","title":"A Random Act of Kindness (S07E05)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":7,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2022-06-01","title":"Wise Owl (S07E06)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":8,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2022-12-22","title":"The Bones of St Nicholas (S08E01)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":8,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2023-04-27","title":"Mother's Ruin (S08E02)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":8,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2023-05-04","title":"Paraskevidekatriaphobia (S08E03)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":8,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2023-05-11","title":"Love Is a Stranger (S08E04)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":8,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2023-05-18","title":"3 by 3 (S08E05)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":8,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2023-05-25","title":"The Last Weekend (S08E06)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":9,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2024-05-08","title":"Boo to a Goose (S09E01)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":9,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2024-05-15","title":"The Trolley Problem (S09E02)","platforms":["BBC iPlayer"]},{"season_no":9,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2024-05-22","title":"Mulberr